<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>Andrus Rinde, veebiprogrammeerimine</title>
</head>
<body>
	<img src="../pic/veebiprogrammeerimine_2026_TA.png" alt="">
	<h1>Eesti filmid</h1>
	<p>Siin lehel on näha filmidega seotud ameteid.</p>
	<hr>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/">Avalehele</a></li>
		<li><a href="/eestifilm">Eesti filmi avaleht</a></li>
	</ul>
	<hr>
    <form method="POST">

       <label for="professionInput">Ameti nimi</label>
       <input
           id="professionInput"
           name="professionInput"
           type="text"
           placeholder="Amet..."
           value="<%= title || '' %>"
           required
       >

        <br>
        <label for="descriptionInput">Kirjeldus</label>
         <input
             id="descriptionInput"
             name="descriptionInput"
             type="text"
             placeholder="Kirjeldus..."
             value="<%= description || '' %>"
             required
         >
         <br>

         <input id="movieSubmit" name = "movieSubmit" type="submit" value = "Salvesta">
        </form>
		<p><%= notice || '' %></p>
</body>
</html>